  "notes": [
    "**Morir** is a stem-changing verb: o→ue in present, o→u in preterite",
    "Present: stem change o→ue (except nosotros)",
    "Preterite: stem change o→u in 3rd person forms (murió, murieron)",
    "Imperfect: regular -IR pattern, NO stem change",
    "Future: regular future endings attached to infinitive",
    "Special pattern like **dormir** - has TWO different stem changes (o→ue and o→u)",
    "Often used reflexively: **morirse** (to die - emphasizes the process)",
    "Irregular past participle: **muerto** (dead/died) - used in perfect tenses: *ha muerto* (has died)",
    "Common usage: *morirse de hambre* (to be starving - literally \"to die of hunger\"), *morirse de risa* (to die laughing)"
  ],
